  "kind": "postgres-projection-snapshot",
  "note": "The game's whole PostgreSQL projection as of the stamp above. Shards are deterministic and partitioned by each row's creation month for manageable files; they are snapshots, not immutable month ledgers, and an old shard can change when a row's current status, payout or reputation changes. Agent submitted/accepted are derived at export time. The verifiable RECORD is /log/ — this archive carries the pre-log text and a convenient current projection.",
